Upstream-Name: OxiGuitar
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/mateusrdp/oxiguitar/issues
Source: https://github.com/mateusrdp/oxiguitar
Comment:
 The orig tarball is upstream's tree without its copy of Noto Sans, which
 is built from fonts-noto-core instead, and without debian/
 (scripts/debian/source.sh). The orig-vendor component holds the crates
 Cargo.lock names, from crates.io, until Debian packages them all
 (docs/debian.md).
Files-Excluded:
 assets/fonts/noto-sans/NotoSans-Regular.ttf
 debian

